   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LOD213 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 10 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13960 · Decision 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 09/04/2026 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">LOD213 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>10 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13960 · QĐ 377/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 09/04/2026 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Analyze the role, organizational structure, and functions of the housekeeping department within hotels, and identify modern operational trends in the hospitality industry.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Apply standardized procedures for inspecting and servicing guest rooms, public areas, and specialized equipment to ensure service quality and safety.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Assess and monitor specifications for supplies, chemicals, and equipment used in housekeeping, in compliance with safety regulations and cost-control practices.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Operate and supervise maintenance tasks, laundry services, inventory distribution, guest guidance, ensuring hotel standards and occupational safety.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Manage human resources in the housekeeping department: planning staff allocation, training programs, performance evaluation, and promoting teamwork and discipline.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Analyze principles of cost control, manage consumables inventory, establish stock auditing procedures, and prepare periodic housekeeping cost reports.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Propose methods to enhance service quality, develop processes for handling guest complaints, and practice effective and professional communication in a multicultural hotel environment.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>CLO8</strong></td><td>Plan, organize, and coordinate the provision of additional services (flowers, beverages, gifts, decorations) to meet special guest requirements for events and small functions in the hotel.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>CLO9</strong></td><td>Demonstrate problem-solving skills for operational incidents (safety, emergencies, property loss, operational risks) encountered in housekeeping operations.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>CLO10</strong></td><td>Commit to professional standards, uphold a positive and responsible attitude, and demonstrate environmental and occupational safety awareness in all professional activities.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13960\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13960</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13960\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13960</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
